   },
   "cite": "rules",
   "prompt": "<p>Given that $\\langle \\kvecv , \\kvecw \\rangle = 3$ and $\\langle \\kvecv , \\kvecu \\rangle = -1$ compute</p><ol type=\"a\"><li>$\\langle \\kvecu , 2 \\kvecv \\rangle$</li><li>$\\langle \\kvecv , 2 \\kvecw + 3 \\kvecu \\rangle$</li><li>$\\langle \\kvecw + 3 \\kvecu, \\kvecv \\rangle$</li></ol>",
   "answer": {
    "type": "multi",
    "generated_by": "ai",
    "parts": [
     {
      "part": "a",
      "value": -2
     },
     {
      "part": "b",
      "value": 3
     },
     {
      "part": "c",
      "value": 0
     }
    ],
    "solution": "a) By rules (iii) and (ii), $\\langle \\kvecu , 2 \\kvecv \\rangle = 2 \\langle \\kvecu , \\kvecv \\rangle = 2 \\langle \\kvecv , \\kvecu \\rangle = 2(-1) = -2$. b) By rules (iv) and (iii), $\\langle \\kvecv , 2 \\kvecw + 3 \\kvecu \\rangle = 2 \\langle \\kvecv , \\kvecw \\rangle + 3 \\langle \\kvecv , \\kvecu \\rangle = 2(3) + 3(-1) = 3$. c) By rules (iv), (iii) and (ii), $\\langle \\kvecw + 3 \\kvecu, \\kvecv \\rangle = \\langle \\kvecv , \\kvecw \\rangle + 3 \\langle \\kvecv , \\kvecu \\rangle = 3 + 3(-1) = 0$."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "e4",
   "source_id": "A.5.4",
   "source_number": "A.5.4",
   "kind": "exercise",
   "bloom": "Apply",
   "place": {
